        38.98  time, RIGHT aligned    12   40x40 r6 artwork    12   title/artist

      74 is 13 + 48 + 13, and the 48 is the frozen mock's title (28) over its
      artist (20). That is the height of ONE line of each, so these are minima and
      the row grows - forcing 74 would mean truncating a real track name to
      preserve the height of a mock one.

